        "TileImage": "$($repository 8c364eb8-cde7-473e-9fa6-5b3a1c7da10e).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning, 47.\r\rYour targets today consist of the infamous Captain Rutherford, an ex-criminal known for his scams and money laundering. He was also a big name in the organised crime sector. Many people have died by his command.\r\rIntel suggests that 3 more lab workers are procuring a never-seen lethal poison which we cannot risk letting out, try giving them a taste of their own medicine...\r\rGood luck 47,\r I shall leave you to prepare",
